    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Echoes of the Valley

    A game for thatgamejam #02, 2026

    Created
    by the developer of this entry


    Made with AI assistance

    All code, dialogue
    and story text, the 3D art (simple shapes assembled by code) and all music and
    sound effects (synthesised by code) were created with AI assistance: Anthropic
    Claude Code, directed by the developer.


    Assets

    No external art, music,
    sound or font files are used. Music and sounds are original and synthesised procedurally.
    The interface uses the font and sprites built into Unity.


    Built with Unity
    6 and its Universal Render Pipeline.


    Thank you for playing.'
